  "body_text": "Our partners\nLDgenX collaborates with research institutes, universities, environmental consultancies and companies to develop innovative scientific solutions.These partnerships bring together complementary expertise to address complex challenges in biodiversity conservation, agriculture, and aquaculture.\n            Public Research Institutes\n        \n        Our expertise is rooted in years of experience within leading public research institutes, where we received our scientific training and carried out our first research projects.\n    \n            Supported by\n        \n            Trusted By\n\nLet’s discuss your project\n        \n        Do you wish to implement biodiversity monitoring, study a population, or develop a specific molecular tool ?\n    \n                Contact our team",
  "metadata_path": "source/en/about-us__partners.json"
